# Secrets Quick Reference

| Environment | Storage |
|------------|---------|
| Dev | .env file (gitignored) |
| CI/CD | CI secret variables |
| Prod | OS keyring / encrypted config |

| Secret Type | Example |
|------------|---------|
| DB password | Encrypted in config or keyring |
| API key | Keyring |
| Encryption key | Derived from user password |